      "description": "Welcome to the Greenbelt 2026 app - your ultimate festival companion.\n\nCreated with you in mind, the app puts the full festival programme in the palm of your hand. It lets you curate your dream schedule, get reminders before your favourite shows start, use our interactive festival map (with live location), explore mouth-watering details about food and drink traders, and search all things Greenbelt to your heart’s content.\n\nThe app is updated in real time, so we can keep you in the loop with any last-minute programme or timing changes - and it even works offline!\n\nThe 2026 edition of the Greenbelt app contains some of your most-requested features, including:\n\n- The clash-finder returns! See our full programme on the brand-new timeline, and easily see which sessions on our schedule are clashing. We hope you like it!\n- Keep track of the notifications you've received with our new notification log. See your unread notifications on the home tab, along with all of your read notifications within the menu. Notifications will now also open with relevant content, making it easier for you to see what's changed.\n- 'Find My' returns with the ability for you to add any location - your tent, car, van, meet-up point, friend's tents, your favourite spot to sit under the trees... truly anything you can think of!\n- Custom sessions! Add your meet-ups with friends, dinner rotas, lunch plans and more - and see them within your personalised schedule.\n- Notes! Want to plan in-depth? You can now add notes against talks / artists / workshops in-app and easily view them in the Notes screen within the menu later on.\n- Improved filtering capabilities - making it easier for you to find what you're looking for.\n\nWe can’t wait to see you in the fields. But for now, download the app, dig in, and enjoy.",
